  "result": "Perfect! I've added the overdue invoice report:\n\n**src/reports.js** \u2014 Added:\n- **overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)** \u2014 Returns overdue invoices report:\n  - Filters invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid' only\n  - Includes only invoices with dueDate **before** asOf (exclusive)\n  - Returns array of `{ number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }`\n  - Sorted by dueDate ascending (most overdue first)\n  - daysOverdue = days between dueDate and asOf\n  - due = balanceDue (accounts for partial payments)\n\n**Key design:**\n- Excludes draft and paid invoices\n- Date boundary is strict (due date before asOf, not equal)\n- Sorts oldest first to highlight most urgent items\n- Calculates days overdue and remaining balance for each invoice\n- Handles partial payments correctly\n\nAdded 15 tests covering:\n- Filtering by status (issued/partially_paid only)\n- Filtering by due date (before asOf only)\n- Sorting (most overdue first)\n- Days overdue calculation\n- Due amount for unpaid and partially paid invoices\n- Multiple customers\n- Discount and VAT handling\n- Empty results\n\nAll 205 tests pass. The invoicing system is now complete with full payment tracking, customer statements, credit notes, and reporting!",
